{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Take the Levites, etc.</b> Rashi explains: take them with words. It appears that the intention is to say that he should separate them from Israel and make for them a Levite camp, because of their need for purification more than the children of Israel. The proof is what the verse concludes: <b>and you shall purify them</b> — see that the verse speaks of requirements of purification."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:06:49.807373253Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}